msgstr ""
"Sincronização em pausa — é necessário confirmar a identidade do arquivo"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1832
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sync failed: {error}"
msgstr "Falha na sincronização: {error}"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1871
msgid "Create a New Sync Archive?"
msgstr "Criar um novo arquivo de sincronização?"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1873
msgid ""
"No existing sync archive was found at this folder — neither this machine nor "
"the folder itself has one yet.\n"
"\n"
"If this is genuinely a new or empty folder, continuing is safe: it seeds the "
"archive from this machine's current hosts/settings. But if this folder is "
"supposed to already have an archive (e.g. a cloud-synced folder that just "
"hasn't finished downloading yet), continuing now would create a SEPARATE, "
"competing archive instead of joining the real one — wait and try again "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1883
msgid "Create and Sync Now"
msgstr "Criar e sincronizar agora"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1896
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "desconhecido"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1899
msgid "Connect to a Different Sync Archive?"
msgstr "Ligar a um arquivo de sincronização diferente?"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1901
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The sync folder now contains a different archive than the one this machine "
"last used (id {sync_id}, last synced {when}, {hosts} hosts, {quickies} "
"Quickies).\n"
"\n"
"This can happen on purpose (a new shared folder, a teammate's archive) or by "
"mistake (the wrong folder was chosen). Continuing merges this machine's "
"local hosts/settings into it — nothing is deleted on either side, but from "
"then on this machine treats that archive as the one it syncs with."
msgstr ""

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1913
msgid "Connect and Sync Now"
msgstr "Ligar e sincronizar agora"

